{"id":1211930,"shortDescription":"Un juego de exploración sobre lazos emocionales más allá de la muerte. La protagonista, Riley, trata con un fantasma terco que la embarca en una aventura por playas evocadoras para descubrir el trágico secreto de las islas. Las opciones de diálogo forjarán su relación y el destino de Riley.","developers":["like Charlie"],"publishers":["Application Systems Heidelberg"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"24 FEB 2022","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1793351951","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211930/ss_6374f695b11a6e5b8686565cde75b5a58dfea073.600x338.jpg?t=1793351951","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211930/ss_6374f695b11a6e5b8686565cde75b5a58dfea073.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793351951"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211930/ss_649535bfd84c18eca4383d4f4a29db7eb2d0cf2a.600x338.jpg?t=1793351951","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211930/ss_649535bfd84c18eca4383d4f4a29db7eb2d0cf2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793351951"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211930/ss_a75d542fe0ed0c9a549d39d3195da4ef7c723ecb.600x338.jpg?t=1793351951","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211930/ss_a75d542fe0ed0c9a549d39d3195da4ef7c723ecb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793351951"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211930/ss_d650682ebc1c15c66f390149ea50cbb3816d6bea.600x338.jpg?t=1793351951","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211930/ss_d650682ebc1c15c66f390149ea50cbb3816d6bea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793351951"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/121